==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|kalp}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kalb}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*kalbaz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*gʷolbʰo-||womb, animal young}}. Compare Dutch {{m|nl|kalf}}, English {{m|en|calf}}, Danish {{m|da|kalv}}.

